medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=20260924_593fdbea6974a40fdf86c8ac</span></a></p>", "reblog": null, "account": {"id": "109264824312325433", "username": "robert_rosendal", "acct": "robert_rosendal@mastodon.green", "display_name": "Robert Rosendal", "locked": false, "bot": false, "discoverable": true, "indexable": false, "group": false, "created_at": "2022-10-31T00:00:00.000Z", "note": "<p>- Initiatiefnemer Kunst en Landschap (<span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.nl/@kunst_landschap\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>kunst_landschap</span></a></span>)<br>- Multimediaal platform voor 'verbeelding' van verandering in Noord Nederland <br>- Slogan: 'Verlangen naar verandering. Zin in de toekomst!'<br>- Start: 2027</p><p>Robert Rosendal: docent Ned./Maatschappijleer, kwartiermaker, Minister v/d Toekomst, uitgever, publicist, tekstsaneerder, organisatie, communicatie, publiciteit, media, vormgeving, onderwijs, acteur/theater, voice over, IJsland(ers)</p><p>Info: <a href=\"https://www.rosendalprodukties.nl\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"\">rosendalprodukties.nl</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p>", "url": "https://mastodon.green/@robert_rosendal", "uri": "https://mastodon.green/users/robert_rosendal", "avatar": "https://files.mastodon.social/cache/accounts/avatars/109/264/824/312/325/433/original/da09178ec56a0db3.jpg", "avatar_static": "https://files.mastodon.social/cache/accounts/avatars/109/264/824/312/325/433/original/da09178ec56a0db3.jpg", "avatar_description": "", "header": "https://files.mastodon.social/cache/accounts/headers/109/264/824/312/325/433/original/46c4c4ddd11e3e0b.png", "header_static": "https://files.mastodon.social/cache/accounts/headers/109/264/824/312/325/433/original/46c4c4ddd11e3e0b.png", "header_description": "", "followers_count": 401, "following_count": 1010, "statuses_count": 451